  m_Name: Heavenly Burgers
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ArticlePageData
  helperWasUsedOnThisArticleState: 0
  articleID: https://NewManilaCityShelter/AboutUs
  title: Heavenly Burgers
  headliner: <b>Get Three Sliders for the Price of One this Weekend !</b>
  bodyText: Clear your schedules and loosen your belts, burger lovers. Local favorite
    Heavenly Burgers has officially announced a city-wide "Buy 1, Take 2" flash event
    on every single item on their menu. The deal runs for exactly one hour next Saturday
    across all four city locations.
  textBeforeUrl: 'More about this story :

'
  externalLinkBodyText: "Our Core Principle: All you need is one good one !\r\nIn
    an era of gimmicky flash sales, bulk discount buckets, and \"Buy X, Get X\" promos,
    Seraphim Sliders takes a deliberate, uncompromising stand. We do not, and will
    never, run multi-buy discount deals.\r\nHeavenly Burger\u2019s founding philosophy
    rests on a fundamental belief: One slider, built perfectly, served fresh to one
    customer at a time.\r\n\"The moment a kitchen starts trying to pump out more
    than one burger for the price of one, quality collapses. Buns get soggy, patties
    sit under warmers, line cooks get burned out, and the customer receives an inferior
    product. We refuse to compromise our integrity just to move volume. Every slider
    that leaves our line is a masterpiece meant to be enjoyed fresh off the grill.
    We price our menu fairly for the premium ingredients we use, and we treat every
    single burger, and every single customer, with the same individual care.\"\r\n\u2014
    Chef Leo Santos, Founder & Head Chef\r\n"
  hasExternalLink: 1
  customComments:
  - "Wait, I thought they didn\u2019t do these types of deals ?"
  - Is this for real ? ill go if it is.
  - Does it come with egg roll ?
